00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Cranston Academy: Monster Zone (formerly Scary Show) is an animated
horror-comedy film directed by Leopoldo Aguilar.

10
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
Produced by Ánima and Prime Focus World, the film is directed by Leopoldo
Aguilar and features the voices of Jamie Bell and Ruby Rose.

11
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
The film was first released in Portugal on March 12, 2020, and later in Mexico on June 26, 2020,
featuring the Spanish voices of Polo Morín, Natalia Téllez, and Edson Zuñiga.

12
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The film was later released in the U.S.

13
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
by Grindstone Entertainment under the title Monster Zone.

14
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
